<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>LA → Erie, CO Road Trip</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;0,900;1,700&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  /* ── PALETTE extracted from the painting ── */
  :root {
    /* backgrounds */
    --cream:   #F5EDE3;   /* warm off-white / light salmon ground */
    --petal:   #EED9D0;   /* soft dusty pink */
    --mauve:   #C8A8B8;   /* lavender-mauve mid */
    /* accents */
    --terracotta: #C85830; /* the rich orange-red */
    --salmon:  #E08068;   /* medium warm salmon */
    --plum:    #5C3040;   /* dark eggplant / near-black */
    --teal:    #2E8090;   /* the teal-blue accent */
    --teal-lt: #6AADBA;   /* lighter blue-teal */
    --olive:   #4A6030;   /* forest olive green */
    --lime:    #A8C858;   /* bright lime-green accent */
    --brown:   #6A3820;   /* warm chocolate */
    --lilac:   #9878A8;   /* mid-purple */
    /* text */
    --ink:     #2E1C14;
    --muted:   #7A6058;

    /* category colors drawn from painting */
    --c-charger: var(--teal);
    --c-hotel:   var(--lilac);
    --c-food:    var(--terracotta);
    --c-coffee:  var(--brown);
    --c-dog:     var(--olive);
  }

  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }

  body {
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  .hdr {
    background: var(--plum);
    padding: 44px 20px 30px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hdr::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 10% 50%, rgba(200,88,48,.18) 0%, transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 90% 30%, rgba(46,128,144,.18) 0%, transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 50% at 50% 90%, rgba(168,200,88,.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hdr-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: .22em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--salmon); margin-bottom: 10px; position: relative;
  }
  .hdr h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5.5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 900; color: var(--petal); line-height: 1.08; position: relative;
  }
  .hdr h1 span { color: var(--salmon); }
  .hdr-sub {
    font-size: 14px; color: rgba(238,217,208,.45);
    margin-top: 9px; position: relative; letter-spacing: .05em;
  }

  /* ── LEGEND ── */
  .legend {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 16px;
    justify-content: center; padding: 13px 20px;
    background: var(--plum);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }
  .leg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .13em;
    color: rgba(238,217,208,.5); }
  .ldot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* ── WRAP ── */
  .wrap { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 26px 16px 60px; }

  /* ── OVERVIEW ── */
  .ov {
    background: var(--plum); border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 22px 22px 18px; margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .ov-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--petal); margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .ov-stats {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(100px,1fr));
    gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .ov-stat { background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 13px; }
  .ov-val { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--petal); line-height: 1; }
  .ov-lbl { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(238,217,208,.4); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; margin-top: 2px; }
  .ov-note {
    font-size: 14.5px; color: rgba(238,217,208,.65); line-height: 1.55;
    background: rgba(46,128,144,.14); border: 1px solid rgba(46,128,144,.25);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 11px 14px;
  }
  .ov-note strong { color: var(--teal-lt); }

  /* ── SEGMENT CONNECTOR ── */
  .seg {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px;
    background: var(--petal); border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 9px 15px; margin: 8px 0;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--mauve);
  }
  .seg-icon { font-size: 17px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .seg-txt { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
  .seg-txt strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ── TOWN ACCORDION ── */
  .town { margin-bottom: 5px; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(46,28,20,.09); }

  .town-btn {
    width: 100%; background: none; border: none;
    cursor: pointer; padding: 0; display: block; text-align: left;
  }

  .town-head {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    padding: 13px 17px; background: #FAF2EA;
    transition: background .18s; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .town-btn:hover .town-head { background: var(--petal); }
  .town-btn.open .town-head { background: var(--petal); }

  .town-name {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink);
    flex: 1; min-width: 0; line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .town-state {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .14em; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ticons { display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }
  .ti { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1; }
  .chev {
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted);
    transition: transform .25s; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 3px;
  }
  .town-btn.open .chev { transform: rotate(180deg); }

  /* ── TOWN BODY ── */
  .town-body { display: none; background: #FAF2EA; border-top: 1px solid var(--petal); padding: 15px 17px 18px; }
  .town-body.open { display: block; }

  /* ── CATEGORY LABEL ── */
  .cat {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .2em;
    color: var(--muted); margin: 15px 0 8px 2px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  }
  .cat:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

  /* ── CHARGER STRIP ── */
  .cs {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between; gap: 9px;
    background: rgba(46,128,144,.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(46,128,144,.22);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 15px; margin-bottom: 9px;
  }
  .cs-l { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .cs-ico { font-size: 22px; }
  .cs-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; color: var(--teal); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .cs-detail { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ── ITEM CARD ── */
  .item {
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 13px 15px; margin-bottom: 7px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--petal);
    background: var(--cream);
    transition: box-shadow .18s, transform .18s;
  }
  .item:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(46,28,20,.1); transform: translateY(-1px); }

  .item.charger { border-left-color: var(--teal);        background: rgba(46,128,144,.04); }
  .item.hotel   { border-left-color: var(--lilac);       background: rgba(152,120,168,.04); }
  .item.food    { border-left-color: var(--terracotta);  background: rgba(200,88,48,.04); }
  .item.coffee  { border-left-color: var(--brown);       background: rgba(106,56,32,.04); }
  .item.dog     { border-left-color: var(--olive);       background: rgba(74,96,48,.04); }

  .item-top { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .item-name { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.2; flex: 1; }

  .badge {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 3px; white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .b-top  { background: rgba(92,48,64,.15);  color: var(--plum);       font-weight: 600; }
  .b-std  { background: rgba(46,28,20,.08);  color: var(--muted); }
  .b-pet  { background: rgba(46,128,144,.12); color: var(--teal); }

  .item-desc { font-size: 15px; color: #3E2818; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 9px; }
  .item-desc em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; color: var(--plum); }

  .item-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }

  .map-btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
    background: var(--plum); color: var(--petal);
    text-decoration: none; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: .06em;
    padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 5px;
    transition: background .15s; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .map-btn:hover { background: var(--terracotta); }

  .rating { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; }
  .stars  { color: #B88010; letter-spacing: -1px; }
  .pet-pill { font-size: 13px; background: rgba(152,120,168,.12); color: var(--lilac); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; }

  /* ── TIPS BOX ── */
  .tips { background: var(--plum); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 22px; margin-top: 26px; }
  .tips-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 16px; color: var(--petal); margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
  .tip { font-size: 14.5px; color: rgba(238,217,208,.7); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 8px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06); }
  .tip:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; border: none; }
  .tip strong { color: rgba(238,217,208,.92); }

  footer {
    text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted);
    padding: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--petal);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .06em;
  }

  @media(max-width: 580px){
    .town-head { padding: 11px 13px; }
    .town-body { padding: 12px 13px 16px; }
    .item { padding: 11px 12px; }
    .ov { padding: 17px 15px 14px; }
    .wrap { padding: 18px 11px 44px; }
    .hdr { padding: 34px 16px 24px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hdr">
  <div class="hdr-eyebrow">🟢 Trip In Progress · Tesla Model Y · Pet Friendly</div>
  <h1>Mesquite, NV <span>→</span> Erie, CO</h1>
  <div class="hdr-sub">Currently charging · Departing ~4:38 pm · Driving until ~9 pm tonight · Tesla GPS routing charges</div>
</header>

<div class="legend">
  <div class="leg"><div class="ldot" style="background:var(--teal)"></div>Supercharger</div>
  <div class="leg"><div class="ldot" style="background:var(--lilac)"></div>Hotel</div>
  <div class="leg"><div class="ldot" style="background:var(--terracotta)"></div>Food</div>
  <div class="leg"><div class="ldot" style="background:var(--brown)"></div>Coffee</div>
  <div class="leg"><div class="ldot" style="background:var(--olive)"></div>Dog Walk</div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

<div class="ov">
  <div class="ov-title">🟢 Day 2 — Departing Mesquite, NV</div>
  <div class="ov-stats">
    <div class="ov-stat"><div class="ov-val">Mesquite</div><div class="ov-lbl">Starting point</div></div>
    <div class="ov-stat"><div class="ov-val">~8:30 am</div><div class="ov-lbl">Departing</div></div>
    <div class="ov-stat"><div class="ov-val">6 pm</div><div class="ov-lbl">Daily cutoff</div></div>
    <div class="ov-stat"><div class="ov-val">239 mi</div><div class="ov-lbl">Range @ 90%</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ov-note"><strong>Today:</strong> Mesquite → St. George (coffee + walk first) → Beaver → Richfield → Green River → Grand Junction → Glenwood Springs. Tesla GPS handles charging. <strong>Aim for:</strong> Glenwood Springs overnight.</div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ START ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="seg" style="background:rgba(46,128,144,.12); border-left-color:var(--teal)"><span class="seg-icon">🟢</span><div class="seg-txt"><strong>Mesquite, NV — Day 2 Start</strong> · Departing ~8:30 am · ~40 min to St. George</div></div>
<!-- MORNING COFFEE + WALK CALLOUT -->
<div style="background:rgba(139,74,26,.08); border:1px solid rgba(139,74,26,.22); border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; margin:6px 0 8px;">
  <div style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.18em; color:var(--brown); margin-bottom:10px;">☕🐾 First Stop — Coffee + On-Leash Walk · St. George, UT · ~40 min from Mesquite</div>
  <div style="font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.65; margin-bottom:12px;">
    Two options that pair coffee and an on-leash walk right together:
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:9px;">
    <div style="background:var(--cream); border-radius:7px; padding:13px 15px; border-left:3px solid var(--brown);">
      <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:3px;">Perks Coffee + Red Hills Desert Garden <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:400;">· Best combo</span></div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px; color:#3E2818; line-height:1.58; margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Perks</strong> (voted best in Southern Utah, opens 7am, in-house roasted) then a 5-min drive to <strong>Red Hills Desert Garden</strong> — 5-acre red-rock conservation garden, paved paths, stream, dinosaur tracks. BringFido's top on-leash pick in St. George. Easy 20-min walk.</div>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Perks+Coffee+Espresso+St+George+Utah" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--plum);color:var(--petal);text-decoration:none;font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:5px;">📍 Perks Coffee</a>
        <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Red+Hills+Desert+Garden+St+George+Utah" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--plum);color:var(--petal);text-decoration:none;font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:5px;">📍 Red Hills Garden</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--cream); border-radius:7px; padding:13px 15px; border-left:3px solid var(--brown);">
      <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:3px;">Cafe FeelLove + Pioneer Park Trail <span style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:400;">· More scenic walk</span></div>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px; color:#3E2818; line-height:1.58; margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Cafe FeelLove</strong> (ranked #1 in St. George, opens 7am, dog-friendly patio) then a short drive to <strong>Pioneer Park</strong> — easy on-leash trails through red sandstone cliffs with panoramic views. Gorgeous in morning light.</div>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Cafe+FeelLove+St+George+Utah" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--plum);color:var(--petal);text-decoration:none;font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:5px;">📍 Cafe FeelLove</a>
        <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Pioneer+Park+St+George+Utah" target="_blank" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--plum);color:var(--petal);text-decoration:none;font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:5px;">📍 Pioneer Park</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>



<!-- ─── BARSTOW ─── -->
<div class="town" style="opacity:0.5">
  <button class="town-btn" onclick="tog(this)">
    <div class="town-head">
      <div class="town-name">Barstow</div><div class="town-state">CA</div>
      <div class="ticons"><span class="ti">⚡</span><span class="ti">🍽️</span><span class="ti">🏨</span><span class="ti">🐾</span></div>
      <span class="chev">▾</span>
    </div>
  </button>
  <div class="town-body">
    <div class="cs"><div class="cs-l"><div class="cs-ico">⚡</div><div><div class="cs-title">Tesla Supercharger — Barstow (Lenwood Rd)</div><div class="cs-detail">2812 Lenwood Rd · I-15 exit 178 · 16+ stalls · Walking distance to restaurants including Oggi's Pizza</div></div></div><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Tesla+Supercharger+2812+Lenwood+Rd+Barstow+CA" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🍽️</span> Food</div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Idle Spurs Steakhouse</div><span class="badge b-top">BEST IN BARSTOW</span></div><div class="item-desc">Best restaurant in Barstow — genuine steakhouse with excellent beef and salads. Reviewers call it a real Mojave surprise.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Idle+Spurs+Steakhouse+Barstow+California" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.4</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Oggi's Pizza &amp; Brewing Co.</div><span class="badge b-std">WALKING FROM CHARGER</span></div><div class="item-desc">Short walk from the Supercharger. Fresh pizza, craft beer, good for waiting out a charge.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Oggi%27s+Pizza+Brewing+Barstow+California" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.2</span></div></div>
    <div class="item food"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Plata's Restaurant</div><span class="badge b-std">LOCAL MEXICAN</span></div><div class="item-desc">Family-owned Mexican, beloved by locals. Fresh, authentic, generously portioned.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Plata%27s+Restaurant+Barstow+California" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="rating"><span class="stars">★★★★</span> 4.3</span></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🐾</span> Dog Walk + Charger Combo</div>
    <div class="item dog"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Barstow Station Grounds</div></div><div class="item-desc">Officially pet-friendly. Walk the perimeter and adjacent desert scrub. Clean restrooms nearby. <em>Bring water — peak Mojave heat.</em></div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Barstow+Station+1611+E+Main+St+Barstow+CA" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a></div></div>
    <div class="cat"><span>🏨</span> Hotels</div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">TownePlace Suites Barstow</div><span class="badge b-top">TOP PICK</span></div><div class="item-desc">Marriott extended-stay, free breakfast, the only pet-friendly Barstow hotel with actual grass. Any size, max 2 pets.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=TownePlace+Suites+Barstow+California" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Any size · grass on site</span></div></div>
    <div class="item hotel"><div class="item-top"><div class="item-name">Home2 Suites by Hilton Barstow</div><span class="badge b-std">RELIABLE</span></div><div class="item-desc">Hilton extended-stay, kitchen suites, indoor pool. Any size, max 2 pets. Good backup to TownePlace.</div><div class="item-meta"><a class="map-btn" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Home2+Suites+Hilton+Barstow+California" target="_blank">📍 Maps</a><span class="pet-pill">🐾 Any size · $50 fee</span></div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="seg"><span class="seg-icon">🚗</span><div class="seg-txt"><strong>Barstow → Primm, NV</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; ~75 mi &nbsp;·&nbsp; ~1 hr &nbsp;·&nbsp; I-15 N · Baker is the midpoint (World's Tallest Thermometer, quirky desert stop) · Mojave opens to Nevada at Primm</div></div>

<!-- ─── PRIMM ─── -->
<div class="town" style="opacity:0.5">
  <button class="town-btn" onclick="tog(this)">
    <div class="town-head">
      <div class="town-name">Primm</div><div class="town-state">NV — CA/NV border</div>
      <div class="ticons"><span class="ti">⚡</span><span class="ti">🍽️</span><span class="ti">🐾</span></div>
      <span class="chev">▾</span>
    </div>
  </button>
  <div class="town-body">
